{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2200303,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200303,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":220030301,"next_line_ids":[220030302],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2327690789,"text":"你在这等等，我把菜做好你顺便送过去。","raw_text":"你在这等等，我把菜做好你顺便送过去。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200303.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2200303,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200303,"sequence":1,"variant":0,"line_id":220030302,"next_line_ids":[220030303],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":2169719557,"text":"你这是什么表情，我不会让你白打工，该给多少我就给你多少。","raw_text":"你这是什么表情，我不会让你白打工，该给多少我就给你多少。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200303.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2200303,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200303,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":220030303,"next_line_ids":[220030304],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":3314657037,"text":"行了，你把饭给那个吃白食的送过去。","raw_text":"行了，你把饭给那个吃白食的送过去。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200303.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":2,"subquest_id":2200303,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200303,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":220030304,"next_line_ids":[220030305],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":4153319173,"text":"那家伙叫江雪，一直在水边钓鱼，一眼就能看见。","raw_text":"那家伙叫<color=#00E1FFFF>江雪</color>，一直在水边钓鱼，一眼就能看见。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200303.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2200304,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200304,"sequence":0,"variant":0,"line_id":220030401,"next_line_ids":[220030402],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":403656453,"text":"快点去吧，免得那个吃白食的饿出个好歹来。","raw_text":"快点去吧，免得那个吃白食的饿出个好歹来。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200304.json"}
