{"chapter_id":"main-quest-22003","main_id":22003,"main_title":"勿言勿笑","main_description":"望舒客栈的厨师言笑，似乎正在因为什么而烦恼…","chapter_title":"勿言勿笑","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":3,"subquest_id":2200304,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2200304,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":220030403,"next_line_ids":[220030404],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":220401,"speaker_text_hash":2182500101,"speaker":"言笑","speaker_raw":"言笑","text_hash":3995600469,"text":"问这个做什么，他个孤家寡人，整个璃月港只认识我一个人，也只敢到我这来蹭吃蹭喝。","raw_text":"问这个做什么，他个孤家寡人，整个璃月港只认识我一个人，也只敢到我这来蹭吃蹭喝。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2200304.json"}
